   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **RTG (Radioisotope Thermoelectric Generator):** turns the decay heat of plutonium-238 into electricity; gives a few hundred watts; used on deep-space probes."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 73,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Environment (Protection) Act, 1986:** the parent law for hazardous microorganisms and GMOs; the Biosafety Rules, 1989 were made under it."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 73,
   "sec": 10,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Bharat Cancer Genome Atlas (BCGA):** released by IIT Madras on 4 February 2026 as India's first cancer genome database; covers paediatric leukaemia, colorectal and pancreatic cancers."
  }
